{"id": "la-001", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：行列式展开/分块", "question": "计算 3 阶行列式 |2 0 0; 0 3 4; 0 4 3| 的值。", "expected_answer": ["-14"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": -14, "tol": 0.001}, "solution_path": "按第一行展开：2·(3·3−4·4) = 2·(9−16) = 2·(−7) = −14。", "key_steps": [{"point": "按第一行展开或分块", "evidence": ["展开", "分块", "余子式"]}, {"point": "二阶子式 3·3−4·4=−7", "evidence": ["9-16", "9−16", "-7", "−7"]}, {"point": "乘回 2 得 −14", "evidence": ["-14", "−14"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "50", "desc": "二阶子式符号错：算成 9+16"}, {"wrong": "=14", "desc": "漏掉负号"}], "notes": "", "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Matrix([[2,0,0],[0,3,4],[0,4,3]]).det())"}}
{"id": "la-002", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：2×2 逆矩阵", "question": "求矩阵 A = [[1,2],[3,4]] 的行列式 det(A) 与逆矩阵 A⁻¹。", "expected_answer": ["-2"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": -2, "tol": 0.001}, "solution_path": "det(A) = 1·4 − 2·3 = −2 ≠ 0，可逆；A⁻¹ = (1/det)·[[4,−2],[−3,1]] = [[−2,1],[1.5,−0.5]]。", "key_steps": [{"point": "det(A)=1·4−2·3=−2", "evidence": ["4-6", "4−6", "det", "-2"]}, {"point": "伴随矩阵并除以 det", "evidence": ["伴随", "adj", "\\frac{1}{-2}", "-\\frac{1}{2}", "1/-2", "-0.5"]}, {"point": "写出 A⁻¹ 各元素", "evidence": ["-2,1", "\\frac{3}{2}", "1.5", "-\\frac{1}{2}", "-0.5"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "det(a)=2", "desc": "det 符号错：算成 4−3 或 3−4"}, {"wrong": "把伴随矩阵当逆矩阵", "desc": "忘了除以 det（伴随矩阵本身当逆）"}], "notes": "逆矩阵本身 v0 只靠 key_steps 证据把关，final_answer 维度只锁 det。", "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Matrix([[1,2],[3,4]]).det())"}}
{"id": "la-003", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：矩阵零因子/可逆性", "question": "请判断这个证明是否正确，若错误请指出：「命题：若 AB=0，则 A=0 或 B=0。证明：AB=0 两边左乘 A⁻¹，得 A⁻¹AB = A⁻¹·0，即 B=0，证毕。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "证明错误：A 未必可逆（可能奇异甚至不是方阵），左乘 A⁻¹ 这一步不成立。反例：A=[[1,0],[0,0]]，B=[[0,0],[0,1]]，AB=0 但两者都非零——矩阵环有零因子。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出 A 不一定可逆", "evidence": ["不可逆", "不一定可逆", "未必可逆", "奇异", "不是方阵", "没有逆"]}, {"point": "给出零因子反例", "evidence": ["反例", "零因子", "[[1,0],[0,0]]"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "证明正确", "desc": "把数的乘法惯性（非零即有逆）搬到矩阵"}], "notes": "", "verify": {"mode": "assert", "expr": "Matrix([[1,0],[0,0]])*Matrix([[0,0],[0,1]]) == zeros(2)"}}
{"id": "la-004", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：特征值与特征向量", "question": "求矩阵 A = [[1,2],[3,2]] 的全部特征值与对应特征向量。", "expected_answer": ["λ=4；λ=−1（特征向量 (2,3)ᵀ 与 (1,−1)ᵀ）"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "mode": "all", "values": [4, -1], "tol": 0.001}, "solution_path": "det(A−λI) = (1−λ)(2−λ)−6 = λ²−3λ−4 = (λ−4)(λ+1)；λ=4 时解 (A−4I)x=0 得 x=(2,3)ᵀ；λ=−1 时得 x=(1,−1)ᵀ。", "key_steps": [{"point": "写出特征多项式 λ²−3λ−4", "evidence": ["λ^2-3λ-4", "λ²-3λ−4", "λ^2-3\\lambda-4", "特征多项式"]}, {"point": "因式分解 (λ−4)(λ+1)", "evidence": ["λ-4", "λ+1"]}, {"point": "分别解 (A−λI)x=0 得特征向量", "evidence": ["(2,3)", "(1,-1)", "(1,−1)", "(2,3)^T"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "λ^2+3λ-4", "desc": "det(A−λI) 展开符号错"}, {"wrong": "λ=1", "desc": "分解时丢负根"}], "notes": "题干数字 1,2,3 与答案 4,−1 无重叠，mode=all 才有意义。", "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "sorted(Matrix([[1,2],[3,2]]).eigenvals().keys())"}}
{"id": "la-005", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：二阶行列式（对角线法则）", "question": "计算行列式 |A|，其中 A = [[3,1],[2,4]]。", "expected_answer": ["10"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 10, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "对角线法则：|A|=3·4−1·2=12−2=10。", "key_steps": [{"point": "对角线法则主对角相乘相减", "evidence": ["对角线", "12-2", "12−2"]}, {"point": "结果 10", "evidence": ["=10", "得10", "为10"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "14", "desc": "把两个对角乘积相加（12+2）"}, {"wrong": "11", "desc": "加减号弄反后算成别的组合"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Matrix([[3,1],[2,4]]).det())"}}
{"id": "la-006", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：克拉默法则解线性方程组", "question": "用克拉默法则解方程组：x+2y=5；3x+y=6。", "expected_answer": ["x=7/5，y=9/5"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "mode": "all", "values": [1.4, 1.8], "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "D=|[[1,2],[3,1]]|=1−6=−5；D_x=|[[5,2],[6,1]]|=5−12=−7，x=7/5；D_y=|[[1,5],[3,6]]|=6−15=−9，y=9/5。", "key_steps": [{"point": "系数行列式 D=−5", "evidence": ["d=-5", "d=−5", "1-6", "1−6"]}, {"point": "替换列算 D_x=−7、D_y=−9", "evidence": ["d_x=-7", "d_x=−7", "d_y=-9", "d_y=−9"]}, {"point": "x=7/5、y=9/5", "evidence": ["7/5", "9/5", "1.4", "1.8"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "x=1,y=2", "desc": "只代一个方程凑整解不验算另一个"}, {"wrong": "y=-9/5", "desc": "克拉默比值的负号丢了"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "[float(v) for v in Matrix([[1,2],[3,1]]).LUsolve(Matrix([5,6]))]"}}
{"id": "la-007", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：矩阵秩（初等行变换）", "question": "求矩阵 A=[[1,0,3],[4,0,9],[7,0,1]] 的秩。", "expected_answer": ["2"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 2, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "第二列全零，秩至多 2；第一、三列不成比例（1/4≠3/9），线性无关，秩为 2。", "key_steps": [{"point": "第二列全零 → 秩 ≤2", "evidence": ["列全零", "零列", "至多"]}, {"point": "一、三列不成比例、线性无关", "evidence": ["不成比例", "线性无关", "无关"]}, {"point": "秩为 2", "evidence": ["秩为2", "秩是2", "r=2", "r(a)=2"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "秩是3", "desc": "没注意零列，把 3×3 当满秩"}, {"wrong": "秩是1", "desc": "把任意两列都当成成比例"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "Matrix([[1,0,3],[4,0,9],[7,0,1]]).rank()"}}
{"id": "la-008", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：对角矩阵求逆", "question": "求 A=[[2,0],[0,5]] 的逆矩阵 A⁻¹。", "expected_answer": ["[[1/2,0],[0,1/5]]", "\\begin{pmatrix}1/2&0\\\\0&1/5\\end{pmatrix}"], "answer_check": {"type": "symbolic"}, "solution_path": "对角矩阵的逆是把对角元取倒数：A⁻¹=[[1/2,0],[0,1/5]]。（验证：乘积应为 I）", "key_steps": [{"point": "对角元取倒数", "evidence": ["倒数", "取倒"]}, {"point": "非对角仍为 0", "evidence": ["非对角"]}, {"point": "A⁻¹=[[1/2,0],[0,1/5]]", "evidence": ["1/2,0", "[1/2,0]", "1/5", "\\frac{1}{2}", "\\frac{1}{5}"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "[[2,0],[0,5]]", "desc": "把原矩阵当逆（没取倒数）"}, {"wrong": "[[1/2,0],[0,5]]", "desc": "只倒了一个对角元"}], "verify": {"mode": "assert", "expr": "simplify(Matrix([[2,0],[0,5]]) * Matrix([[Rational(1,2),0],[0,Rational(1,5)]]) - eye(2)) == zeros(2)"}}
{"id": "la-009", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：三阶行列式（余子式展开）", "question": "计算行列式 |[[1,2,3],[4,5,6],[7,8,10]]|。", "expected_answer": ["−3"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": -3, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "按第一行展开：1·(5·10−6·8) − 2·(4·10−6·7) + 3·(4·8−5·7) = 1·2 − 2·(−2) + 3·(−3) = 2+4−9 = −3。", "key_steps": [{"point": "按第一行展开成三个二阶子式", "evidence": ["展开", "余子式", "代数余子"]}, {"point": "子式组合 2+4−9", "evidence": ["2+4−9", "2+4-9", "2+4"]}, {"point": "结果 −3", "evidence": ["=-3", "=−3", "得−3"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "0", "desc": "惯性以为连续整数行列式必为 0（把 9 换成 10 正是防这个）"}, {"wrong": "结果是3", "desc": "漏负号"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Matrix([[1,2,3],[4,5,6],[7,8,10]]).det())"}}
{"id": "la-010", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：矩阵方程 AX=B", "question": "设 A=[[4,2],[1,3]]，B=(16,13)ᵀ，解矩阵方程 AX=B（即求 X）。", "expected_answer": ["X=(11/5, 18/5)ᵀ"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "mode": "all", "values": [2.2, 3.6], "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "X=A⁻¹B。det A=12−2=10；A⁻¹=(1/10)[[3,−2],[−1,4]]；X=(1/10)(3·16−2·13, −1·16+4·13)=(22/10, 36/10)=(11/5, 18/5)。", "key_steps": [{"point": "det A=10，求 A⁻¹（伴随除以 det）", "evidence": ["伴随", "逆", "det", "10"]}, {"point": "乘 B 得 (22, 36)/10", "evidence": ["22/10", "36/10", "22", "36"]}, {"point": "X=(11/5, 18/5)", "evidence": ["(11/5,18/5)", "2.2", "3.6", "11/5", "18/5"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "x=4,y=2", "desc": "用 B 的分量当解（没乘逆）"}, {"wrong": "x=2,y=6", "desc": "伴随矩阵位置没转置"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "[float(v) for v in Matrix([[4,2],[1,3]]).LUsolve(Matrix([16,13]))]"}}
{"id": "la-011", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：特征值（实对称矩阵）", "question": "求矩阵 A=[[3,1],[1,3]] 的全部特征值。", "expected_answer": ["λ=4 与 λ=2"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "mode": "all", "values": [4, 2], "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "det(A−λI)=(3−λ)²−1=λ²−6λ+8=(λ−4)(λ−2)；特征值为 4 与 2。", "key_steps": [{"point": "特征多项式 λ²−6λ+8", "evidence": ["λ^2-6λ+8", "λ²−6λ+8", "特征多项式"]}, {"point": "分解 (λ−4)(λ−2)", "evidence": ["λ-4", "λ−4", "λ-2", "λ−2"]}, {"point": "特征值 4 与 2", "evidence": ["λ=4", "λ=2"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "λ=1", "desc": "分解成 (λ−1)(λ−2)（常数项算错）"}, {"wrong": "λ=-4", "desc": "符号全反（展开丢了 −1）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "sorted(Matrix([[3,1],[1,3]]).eigenvals().keys())"}}
{"id": "la-012", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：向量的正交投影", "question": "求向量 v=(3,4) 在向量 u=(1,1) 方向上的正交投影向量。", "expected_answer": ["(7/2, 7/2)"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "mode": "all", "values": [3.5, 3.5], "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "proj = (v·u)/(u·u) · u = (3+4)/(1+1) · (1,1) = (7/2)(1,1) = (7/2, 7/2)。", "key_steps": [{"point": "投影公式 (v·u)/(u·u)·u", "evidence": ["投影公式", "内积", "点积"]}, {"point": "系数 7/2", "evidence": ["7/2", "3.5"]}, {"point": "投影 (7/2,7/2)", "evidence": ["(7/2,7/2)", "(3.5,3.5)"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "(4,4)", "desc": "忘了除 |u|²=2"}, {"wrong": "(7,7)", "desc": "只用 v·u=7 当系数"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "[Rational(3*1+4*1, 1*1+1*1)*1, Rational(3*1+4*1, 1*1+1*1)*1]"}}
{"id": "la-013", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：矩阵乘法不可交换", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「对任意方阵 A、B，(A+B)² = A² + 2AB + B²。因为完全平方公式对代数式都成立。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。矩阵乘法不满足交换律，(A+B)²=A²+AB+BA+B²，中间两项一般不能合并成 2AB（除非 AB=BA）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出矩阵乘法不可交换", "evidence": ["不可交换", "交换律", "ab≠ba"]}, {"point": "正确展开 A²+AB+BA+B²", "evidence": ["a²+ab+ba+b²", "a^2+ab+ba+b^2"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "公式成立", "desc": "把数的代数公式直接搬到矩阵"}]}
{"id": "la-014", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：乘积逆的顺序", "question": "请判断下面解法是否正确，若错误请给出正确公式：「A、B 都可逆时，(AB)⁻¹ = A⁻¹B⁻¹。因为分别取逆再乘起来即可。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "解法错误：(AB)⁻¹=B⁻¹A⁻¹，顺序要反过来。验证：AB·B⁻¹A⁻¹=A·(BB⁻¹)·A⁻¹=I；而 AB·A⁻¹B⁻¹ 一般消不掉。", "key_steps": [{"point": "给出正确公式 (AB)⁻¹=B⁻¹A⁻¹（顺序反）", "evidence": ["b⁻¹a⁻¹", "b^{-1}a^{-1}", "顺序", "反过来"]}, {"point": "用结合律验证乘回单位阵", "evidence": ["验证", "单位阵", "消去", "结合律"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "a⁻¹b⁻¹", "desc": "套用「各自取逆」的直觉丢了顺序反转"}]}
{"id": "la-015", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：幂等矩阵的消去谬误", "question": "请判断下面论证是否正确，若错误请给出反例：「若 A²=A，则 A=I 或 A=0。证明：A²=A 即 A·A=A·I，两边消去 A 得 A=I；若 A 不可逆则为 0。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "论证错误：A 不可逆时不能消去。反例：投影矩阵 P=[[1,0],[0,0]]，P²=P 但 P≠I 且 P≠0。幂等矩阵对应投影，一族都不是 I 或 0。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出消去律对不可逆矩阵不成立", "evidence": ["不可逆", "不能消去", "消去律", "消去"]}, {"point": "给出投影反例 P=[[1,0],[0,0]]", "evidence": ["反例", "投影", "[[1,0],[0,0]]", "[1,0],[0,0]"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "证明正确", "desc": "把数的消去律用到矩阵上"}]}
{"id": "la-016", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "concept", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "探针：正交矩阵的行列式", "question": "有同学说：「正交矩阵的行列式一定是 1，因为正交变换不改变长度。」这个说法对吗？请说明并举例。", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。由 AAᵀ=I 取行列式得 (det A)²=1，所以 det A=±1。旋转矩阵（如 [[0,−1],[1,0]]）行列式为 1；反射矩阵（如 diag(1,−1)）行列式为 −1，同样是正交矩阵。「不改变长度」推不出「不改变定向」。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出 det A=±1（平方等于 1）", "evidence": ["±1", "正负", "平方"]}, {"point": "给出 det=−1 的反射例子", "evidence": ["反射", "diag(1,−1)", "[1,0],[0,-1]", "镜像", "翻转"]}, {"point": "说明保长度与定向无关", "evidence": ["定向", "长度", "不矛盾"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "一定是1", "desc": "把「保长度」误推成「保定向」"}]}
{"id": "la-017", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：迹与行列式", "question": "设 A=[[3,1],[0,2]]，求迹 tr(A) 与行列式 det(A)。", "expected_answer": ["tr=5，det=6"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "mode": "all", "values": [5, 6], "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "迹＝主对角元之和 3+2=5；上三角矩阵行列式＝对角元之积 3·2=6。", "key_steps": [{"point": "迹＝主对角之和 3+2=5", "evidence": ["3+2", "迹", "对角之和"]}, {"point": "上三角行列式＝对角之积 6", "evidence": ["对角之积", "三角", "2", "6"]}, {"point": "tr=5、det=6", "evidence": ["5", "6"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "把所有元素相加当迹", "desc": "迹只取主对角元"}, {"wrong": "把迹当行列式", "desc": "两个概念混淆"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "[float(Matrix([[3,1],[0,2]]).trace()), float(Matrix([[3,1],[0,2]]).det())]"}}
{"id": "la-018", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：行列式的数乘性质", "question": "设 A 是 3 阶方阵且 det(A)=3，求 det(2A)。", "expected_answer": ["24"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 24, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "数乘性质：det(kA)=kⁿ·det(A)，n=3；det(2A)=2³·3=8·3=24。", "key_steps": [{"point": "性质 det(kA)=kⁿdet(A)（n=3）", "evidence": ["kⁿ", "k^n", "立方", "3次"]}, {"point": "2³=8", "evidence": ["2³", "2^3", "8"]}, {"point": "det(2A)=24", "evidence": ["24"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "6", "desc": "只乘一个 2（忘了 n 次幂）"}, {"wrong": "48", "desc": "用了 2⁴ 或把 det 翻倍两次"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(2**3 * 3)"}}
{"id": "la-019", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：齐次方程组解空间维数", "question": "设 A 是 5×7 矩阵，秩 r(A)=4。齐次方程组 Ax=0 的解空间维数是多少？", "expected_answer": ["3"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 3, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "解空间维数＝未知数个数−秩＝7−4=3。", "key_steps": [{"point": "公式 维数=n−r", "evidence": ["n−r", "n-r", "减去秩", "个数减"]}, {"point": "7−4=3", "evidence": ["7-4", "7−4"]}, {"point": "维数 3", "evidence": ["维数3", "维数为3", "3维"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "维数5", "desc": "用行数 5 当未知数个数"}, {"wrong": "维数4", "desc": "忘了减秩，把秩当维数"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(7-4)"}}
{"id": "la-020", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：向量范数", "question": "求向量 v=(2,3,6) 的长度（欧几里得范数）。", "expected_answer": ["7"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 7, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "‖v‖=√(2²+3²+6²)=√(4+9+36)=√49=7。", "key_steps": [{"point": "平方和 4+9+36=49", "evidence": ["4+9+36", "4+9", "49"]}, {"point": "开方得 7", "evidence": ["√49", "sqrt(49)", "=7", "为7"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "11", "desc": "把分量直接相加 2+3+6"}, {"wrong": "根号11", "desc": "先开方再相加（√2+√3+√6 的思路）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(sqrt(4+9+36))"}}
{"id": "la-021", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：二次型的矩阵（交叉项折半）", "question": "写出二次型 f(x,y)=2x²+4xy+5y² 的矩阵 A（对称），并求 det(A)。", "expected_answer": ["det=6"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 6, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "交叉项 4xy 折半放到对称位置：A=[[2,2],[2,5]]；det=2·5−2·2=6。", "key_steps": [{"point": "交叉项系数折半放对称位置", "evidence": ["折半", "对称", "一半"]}, {"point": "A=[[2,2],[2,5]]", "evidence": ["[[2,2],[2,5]]", "[2,2],[2,5]", "2,2", "2,5"]}, {"point": "det=10−4=6", "evidence": ["10-4", "10−4", "det=6", "=6"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "det=8", "desc": "交叉项没折半，矩阵写成 [[2,4],[4,5]]（det=−6）之外乱算"}, {"wrong": "det=2", "desc": "对角相减时把位置放错"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Matrix([[2,2],[2,5]]).det())"}}
{"id": "la-022", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：凯莱-哈密顿定理降幂", "question": "设 A=[[1,2],[0,1]]。利用凯莱-哈密顿定理求 A³，并给出 A³ 的 (1,2) 位置元素。", "expected_answer": ["(1,2) 元 = 6"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 6, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "特征多项式 (λ−1)²=λ²−2λ+1，凯莱-哈密顿：A²=2A−I；A³=A(2A−I)=2A²−A=2(2A−I)−A=3A−2I=[[3,6],[0,3]]−[[2,0],[0,2]]=[[1,6],[0,1]]；(1,2) 元为 6。", "key_steps": [{"point": "特征多项式 (λ−1)²", "evidence": ["(λ−1)²", "(λ-1)^2", "(λ-1)2", "特征多项式"]}, {"point": "A²=2A−I 降幂递推", "evidence": ["2a−i", "2a-i", "降幂", "凯莱", "哈密顿"]}, {"point": "A³=[[1,6],[0,1]]，(1,2) 元 6", "evidence": ["[[1,6],[0,1]]", "[1,6],[0,1]", "(1,2)"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "仍是2", "desc": "以为幂运算不改变非对角元（2ⁿ 忘了 n=3 时是 2·3=6）"}, {"wrong": "8", "desc": "把非对角元当成 2³"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float((Matrix([[1,2],[0,1]])**3)[0,1])"}}
{"id": "la-023", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：旋转矩阵的复特征值", "question": "求矩阵 A=[[0,−1],[1,0]]（90° 旋转矩阵）的全部特征值。", "expected_answer": ["λ=±i（i 与 −i）"], "answer_check": {"type": "symbolic"}, "solution_path": "det(A−λI)=λ²+1=0，实矩阵可以有复特征值：λ=±i。", "key_steps": [{"point": "特征方程 λ²+1=0", "evidence": ["λ²+1", "λ^2+1", "λ²＋1"]}, {"point": "复特征值 ±i", "evidence": ["±i", "i和−i", "i与−i", "复特征值", "虚数"]}, {"point": "没有实特征值（旋转不变实方向）", "evidence": ["没有实", "无实", "实特征值"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "λ=±1", "desc": "把 λ²+1=0 当 λ²−1=0 解"}, {"wrong": "无特征值", "desc": "以为实矩阵只有实特征值"}], "verify": {"mode": "assert", "expr": "set(Matrix([[0,-1],[1,0]]).eigenvals().keys()) == {I, -I}"}}
{"id": "la-024", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：高斯消元解方程组", "question": "解线性方程组：2x+y=9；x−2y=0。", "expected_answer": ["x=3.6，y=1.8"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "mode": "all", "values": [3.6, 1.8], "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "由第二式 x=2y 代入第一式：4y+y=9，y=1.8，x=3.6。", "key_steps": [{"point": "消元（代入或加减法）", "evidence": ["消元", "代入", "加减"]}, {"point": "5y=9 得 y=1.8", "evidence": ["5y=9", "5y＝9", "y=1.8", "1.8"]}, {"point": "x=3.6", "evidence": ["x=3.6", "3.6", "x=2y"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "x=4,y=1", "desc": "凑整数解不验算"}, {"wrong": "解对调了", "desc": "x 与 y 的值互换（该验算）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "[float(v) for v in Matrix([[2,1],[1,-2]]).LUsolve(Matrix([9,0]))]"}}
{"id": "la-025", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：零向量不是特征向量", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「零向量 0 是任何方阵 A 的特征向量，因为 A·0=0=λ·0 对任何 λ 都成立。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。特征向量的定义要求非零向量：A x=λx 中的 x 必须满足 x≠0，否则任何 λ 都「成立」，特征值就失去意义。零向量被定义排除。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出特征向量必须非零（定义要求）", "evidence": ["非零", "定义", "必须非零"]}, {"point": "说明否则任何 λ 都满足、特征值失去意义", "evidence": "失去意义"}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "零向量是特征向量", "desc": "只验证了方程没看定义的非零要求"}]}
{"id": "la-026", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：det=0 时的解的情况", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「若 det(A)=0，则方程组 Ax=b 一定无解；若 det(A)≠0，则有唯一解。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "后半句对（克莱姆法则），前半句错：det=0 时 Ax=b 可能无解，也可能有无穷多解（取决于 b 是否落在列空间）。例如 A=0 而 b=0 时有无穷多解。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出 det=0 时可能无解也可能无穷多解", "evidence": ["无穷多", "两种可能", "不一定", "也可能"]}, {"point": "关键看 b 是否在列空间/秩是否相等", "evidence": ["列空间", "秩", "r(a)=r(a|b)", "增广"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "则无解", "desc": "把「唯一解失效」当成「必无解」"}]}
{"id": "la-027", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：相似矩阵保持的是什么", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「若 B=P⁻¹AP（A 与 B 相似），则 A 与 B 有相同的特征向量，因为它们本质上是一个线性变换。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。相似矩阵保持的是特征值（与行列式、迹、秩），特征向量一般不同：若 A x=λx，则 B(P⁻¹x)=P⁻¹Ax=λ(P⁻¹x)，特征向量被 P⁻¹ 变换。「本质上同一变换」指的是换基下的表示，基变了坐标（特征向量坐标）自然变。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出相似保持特征值但不保持特征向量", "evidence": ["特征值", "不保持", "特征向量不同", "变了"]}, {"point": "给出关系 x↔P⁻¹x", "evidence": ["p⁻¹x", "p^{-1}x", "换基", "坐标"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "特征向量相同", "desc": "把「同一变换不同基」误读成「一切相同」"}]}
{"id": "la-028", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "concept", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "探针：满秩与可对角化", "question": "有同学说：「n 阶矩阵只要秩是 n（满秩、可逆），就一定可以对角化。」这个说法对吗？请说明并给出反例（若有）。", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。可对角化要求有 n 个线性无关的特征向量，与满秩无关。反例：[[1,1],[0,1]] 满秩（det=1），但特征值只有 1（二重），特征向量只有 (1,0) 方向一个，几何重数 1<2，不可对角化。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出可对角化看的是特征向量个数而非秩", "evidence": ["特征向量", "个数", "无关"]}, {"point": "给出反例 [[1,1],[0,1]]（若尔当块）", "evidence": ["[[1,1],[0,1]]", "[1,1],[0,1]", "若尔当", "约当"]}, {"point": "指出几何重数<代数重数", "evidence": ["几何重数", "代数重数", "重数"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "说法对", "desc": "把可逆与可对角化混为一谈"}]}
{"id": "la-029", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "basic", "topic": "考点：施密特正交化", "question": "对向量组 v1=(1,1,0)、v2=(0,1,1) 做施密特正交化，求正交化后向量 u2 的模的平方。", "expected_answer": ["3/2"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 1.5, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "u2 = v2 − (v2·v1)/(v1·v1)·v1 = (0,1,1) − (1/2)(1,1,0) = (−1/2, 1/2, 1)；‖u2‖² = 1/4+1/4+1 = 3/2。", "key_steps": [{"point": "减去 v2 在 v1 上的投影", "evidence": ["投影", "减去", "正交化"]}, {"point": "u2=(−1/2, 1/2, 1)", "evidence": ["(−1/2,", "(-1/2,", "1/2,1)"]}, {"point": "模方 1/4+1/4+1=3/2", "evidence": ["3/2", "1.5", "\\frac{3}{2}"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "模方为3", "desc": "忘了减投影，直接算 ‖v2‖²"}, {"wrong": "模方为1", "desc": "投影系数算错后只剩一个分量的平方"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float((Matrix([0,1,1]) - Rational(1,2)*Matrix([1,1,0])).dot(Matrix([0,1,1]) - Rational(1,2)*Matrix([1,1,0])))"}}
{"id": "la-030", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：最小二乘拟合", "question": "用最小二乘法对点 (0,0)、(1,1)、(2,3) 拟合直线 y=a+bx，求 a 与 b。", "expected_answer": ["a=−1/6，b=3/2"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "mode": "all", "values": [-0.1667, 1.5], "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "正规方程：3a+3b=4，3a+5b=7（Σx=3、Σy=4、Σx²=5、Σxy=7）；两式相减 2b=3，b=3/2，a=(4−9/2)/3=−1/6。", "key_steps": [{"point": "列正规方程 3a+3b=4；3a+5b=7", "evidence": ["正规方程", "3a+3b=4", "3a+5b=7", "3a+3b＝4"]}, {"point": "解出 b=3/2", "evidence": ["b=3/2", "b=1.5", "2b=3"]}, {"point": "a=−1/6", "evidence": ["a=−1/6", "a=-1/6", "−1/6", "-1/6", "−0.167", "-0.167"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "a=0,b=1", "desc": "取前两点连线当拟合线"}, {"wrong": "b=2", "desc": "正规方程系数求错（Σx² 用成 Σx）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "[float(v) for v in Matrix([[3,3],[3,5]]).LUsolve(Matrix([4,7]))]"}}
{"id": "la-031", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：矩阵幂的迹", "question": "设 A=[[1,2],[3,4]]，求 tr(A²)。", "expected_answer": ["29"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 29, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "A²=[[1·1+2·3, 1·2+2·4],[3·1+4·3, 3·2+4·4]]=[[7,10],[15,22]]；迹=7+22=29。（也可用 tr(A²)=λ₁²+λ₂² 验算）", "key_steps": [{"point": "算出 A²=[[7,10],[15,22]]", "evidence": ["[[7,10],[15,22]]", "[7,10],[15,22]", "7,10"]}, {"point": "迹=7+22=29", "evidence": ["7+22", "迹=29", "迹是29"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "迹是7", "desc": "只取了 A² 的一个对角元"}, {"wrong": "迹是15", "desc": "取错对角元（把非对角元 15 加进去）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float((Matrix([[1,2],[3,4]])**2).trace())"}}
{"id": "la-032", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：几何重数与可对角化", "question": "求矩阵 A=[[5,3],[0,5]] 的特征值 5 的几何重数（即 A−5I 的零空间维数），并据此说明 A 是否可对角化。", "expected_answer": ["几何重数 1，不可对角化"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 1, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "A−5I=[[0,3],[0,0]]，秩 1，零空间维数=2−1=1；代数重数 2＞几何重数 1，特征向量不够 2 个，A 不可对角化。", "key_steps": [{"point": "A−5I=[[0,3],[0,0]]，秩 1", "evidence": ["[[0,3],[0,0]]", "[0,3],[0,0]", "秩1", "秩为1"]}, {"point": "几何重数=2−1=1", "evidence": ["几何重数", "2−1", "2-1", "零空间维数"]}, {"point": "1<2 故不可对角化", "evidence": ["不可对角化", "不能对角化", "无法对角化"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "几何重数2", "desc": "以为上三角也能对角化（混淆「有重根」与「可对角」）"}, {"wrong": "几何重数0", "desc": "零空间维数与秩弄反"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "len((Matrix([[5,3],[0,5]]) - 5*eye(2)).nullspace())"}}
{"id": "la-033", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：行列式与逆的运算律", "question": "设 A、B 都是 3 阶方阵，det(A)=2，det(B)=3，求 det(A·B⁻¹)。", "expected_answer": ["2/3"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 0.6667, "tol": 0.005}, "solution_path": "det(B⁻¹)=1/det(B)=1/3；det(A·B⁻¹)=2·(1/3)=2/3。", "key_steps": [{"point": "det(B⁻¹)=1/det(B)=1/3", "evidence": ["1/3", "det(b⁻¹)", "det(b^{-1})", "倒数"]}, {"point": "乘起来 2/3", "evidence": ["2/3", "0.667", "0.667", "\\frac{2}{3}"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "值是6", "desc": "把逆的行列式当 det(B) 乘了"}, {"wrong": "1.5", "desc": "比值倒置成 3/2"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Rational(2,3))"}}
{"id": "la-034", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：分块三角行列式", "question": "计算行列式 |M|，其中 M=[[3,1,0],[2,2,0],[6,0,5]]（提示：可按第三列展开或用分块）。", "expected_answer": ["20"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": 20, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "按第三列展开只剩 5·|[[3,1],[2,2]]|=5·(6−2)=5·4=20；分块视角：M=[[A,0],[C,B]]，det=det(A)·det(B)=4·5=20。", "key_steps": [{"point": "按第三列展开（或分块）", "evidence": ["第三列", "展开", "分块"]}, {"point": "二阶块行列式 4", "evidence": ["6−2", "6-2", "4"]}, {"point": "5·4=20", "evidence": ["=20", "得20", "为20"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "行列式为0", "desc": "看到分块里的零块就把行列式当 0"}, {"wrong": "40", "desc": "把 5 乘了两次（展开与分块各乘一遍）"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Matrix([[3,1,0],[2,2,0],[6,0,5]]).det())"}}
{"id": "la-035", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：正交矩阵列向量的性质", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「正交矩阵的列向量只要线性无关就够了，不必两两正交。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。正交矩阵的定义要求列向量是标准正交组：两两正交且每个都是单位向量（这正是 QᵀQ=I 的含义）。仅线性无关只构成一组基，不一定正交。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出列向量必须标准正交（两两正交＋单位长度）", "evidence": ["标准正交", "两两正交", "单位长度", "单位向量"]}, {"point": "与 QᵀQ=I 对应", "evidence": ["qᵀq", "q^tq", "qᵀq=1"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "只是线性无关", "desc": "把「可逆」与「正交」的条件混同"}]}
{"id": "la-036", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "考点：实对称矩阵特征向量的正交性", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「实对称矩阵属于不同特征值的特征向量只是碰巧有时正交，一般也可能不正交。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。实对称矩阵（谱定理）保证：不同特征值对应的特征向量必定正交，不是碰巧。证明要点：λ₁x₁ᵀx₂=x₁ᵀAx₂=(Ax₁)ᵀx₂=λ₂x₁ᵀx₂，λ₁≠λ₂ 迫使 x₁ᵀx₂=0。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出必正交（谱定理保证）", "evidence": ["必正交", "必定正交", "谱定理", "一定正交"]}, {"point": "给出内积论证（λ₁≠λ₂ ⇒ x₁ᵀx₂=0）", "evidence": ["x₁ᵀx₂", "x_1^tx_2", "内积", "迫使"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "可能不正交", "desc": "把一般矩阵的性质误套到实对称矩阵"}]}
{"id": "la-037", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "error_catch", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：初等行变换保持什么", "question": "请判断下面说法是否正确，若错误请说明：「初等行变换不改变特征值。所以把 A 化成行阶梯形后，对角线上的元素就是 A 的特征值。」", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。初等行变换只保持秩（与线性方程组的解），不保持特征值；行阶梯形不是相似变换。保持特征值的是相似变换（B=P⁻¹AP）。例：[[1,1],[0,1]] 交换两行得 [[0,1],[1,1]]，特征值已经不同。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出行变换不保持特征值（只保秩）", "evidence": ["不保持", "只保", "秩", "改变特征值"]}, {"point": "保持特征值的是相似变换", "evidence": ["相似", "p⁻¹ap", "p^{-1}ap"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "不改变特征值", "desc": "把「解方程组可用行变换」误推到特征值问题"}]}
{"id": "la-038", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "concept", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "探针：det=0 与特征值", "question": "有同学说：「行列式等于 0 的矩阵没有任何特征值，因为 det(A)=0 说明它退化。」这个说法对吗？请说明 det=0 到底意味着什么。", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。det(A)=∏λᵢ，行列式为 0 恰恰说明 0 是 A 的一个特征值（存在非零 x 使 Ax=0）。det=0 意味着 A 不可逆、有零特征值、核非平凡，而不是「没有特征值」。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出 det=0 ⇔ 0 是特征值", "evidence": ["0是特征值", "特征值为0", "零特征值"]}, {"point": "给出 det=∏λ 的联系", "evidence": ["∏λ", "det是特征值之积", "特征值之积", "乘积"]}, {"point": "说明 det=0 的真实含义（不可逆/核非平凡）", "evidence": ["不可逆", "核", "退化"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "没有特征值", "desc": "把「退化」误读成「没有特征值」"}]}
{"id": "la-039", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "solve", "difficulty": "medium", "topic": "考点：基下的坐标", "question": "在 R² 取基 B={(1,0),(1,1)}。求向量 (3,5) 在基 B 下的坐标 (c1,c2) 中的 c1。", "expected_answer": ["c1=−2"], "answer_check": {"type": "numeric", "value": -2, "tol": 0.01}, "solution_path": "c1(1,0)+c2(1,1)=(3,5)：由第二分量 c2=5；第一分量 c1+5=3，c1=−2。", "key_steps": [{"point": "列方程 c1+c2=3；c2=5", "evidence": ["c1+c2=3", "c2=5", "c1+c2＝3"]}, {"point": "解出 c1=−2", "evidence": ["c1=−2", "c1=-2", "−2", "-2"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "c1=3", "desc": "把标准坐标当新基坐标"}, {"wrong": "c1=5", "desc": "两个坐标对调"}], "verify": {"mode": "value", "expr": "float(Matrix([[1,1],[0,1]]).LUsolve(Matrix([3,5]))[0])"}}
{"id": "la-040", "domain": "linear_algebra", "kind": "concept", "difficulty": "hard", "topic": "探针：正定与对角", "question": "有同学说：「正定矩阵一定是对角矩阵，因为只有对角线上都是正数才保证 xᵀAx>0。」这个说法对吗？请说明并给出反例（若有）。", "expected_answer": [], "answer_check": {}, "solution_path": "说法错误。正定由 xᵀAx>0 对一切非零 x 成立定义，不要求对角。反例：[[2,1],[1,2]]，顺序主子式 2>0、3>0，正定，但非对角。对角线全正也不保证正定（如 [[1,9],[9,1]] 的主子式 1−81<0 不正定）。", "key_steps": [{"point": "指出正定看的是 xᵀAx>0 或顺序主子式，不要求对角", "evidence": ["不要求对角", "非对角", "xᵀax", "x^tax", "顺序主子式"]}, {"point": "给出正定的非对角反例 [[2,1],[1,2]]", "evidence": ["[[2,1],[1,2]]", "[2,1],[1,2]", "2>0", "3>0"]}, {"point": "指出对角线全正推不出正定", "evidence": ["推不出", "不够", "1−81", "不保证"]}], "common_errors": [{"wrong": "一定是对角", "desc": "把判定充分条件误当成矩阵形状要求"}]}
